        "Description": "A client from Milton-Fitzpatrick claims bankers Logan Jackson, Jimmie Gladwin and guards Frank Winkleman, Ruben Ferguson created a severely &quot;toxic&quot; work environment.\r\rMake it literal! The client demands absolute decorum: remain in your suit and no unauthorized harm to the bank staff and property - no pacifications and zero damage on the survalliance cameras.\r\rDeliver the venom and stroll out before the market closes.",
